tags: entry_metadata

A setting of the root filesystem: the tree carries metadata in the xattrs of each
entry. The value is empty: any other value is not valid.

The keys are mode, uid, gid, mtime_ns, device.major, device.minor and device.is_block,
as base-10 integers in UTF-8 text. An entry has all the keys or none. An entry with
none gets the default of the node. A node that finds one of the keys in a tree without
this setting does not run the service.

=== formal
encoding=base-10 integers as UTF-8 text
entry=all keys or none
keys=device.is_block,device.major,device.minor,gid,mode,mtime_ns,uid
nondevice=device.is_block, device.major and device.minor are 0
place=filesystem.root
setting=entry_metadata
